# graphify local code-graph index - regenerate with `graphify update .`, not a project artifact
/graphify-out/

# Test-run output. The commands in Documentation/TESTING.md write these into the
# project root, and -executeMethod runs add more; they are results, not sources -
# re-run the suites to regenerate. Pattern rather than a list, because every new
# diagnostic invents another log name.
/*.log
/*.xml

# Regenerable content dump behind Documentation/WALKTHROUGH.md.
# Rebuild with PSM2 > Content > Dump Question Banks to Text.
/bankdump.txt
